content.thinking:
编译通过。**第 6 步**：实现 `TailBindingService`。

职责：
- `bind(jobId, TailBindRequest)` — 幂等键 "TAIL_BIND"
- `confirm(jobId, TailConfirmRequest)` — "TAIL_CONFIRM"
- `unbind(jobId, TailUnbindRequest)` — "TAIL_UNBIND"
- `getHistory(jobId)` — 证据查询
- 内部方法（供 TrainJobService 同事务调用）：
  - `invalidateConfirmations(jobId)` — 摘挂变更时
  - `releaseOnClosure(jobId)` — 销记时
  - `requireDepartureReady(JobRow job, List<CarRow> activeCars)` — 发车确认时（仅受控作业调用）

依赖：TrainJobRepository、TrainCarRepository、TailDeviceRepository、TailBindingRepository、TailConfirmationRepository、IdempotencyService、Clock。

绑定逻辑：
```java
private TailBindingResponse doBind(long jobId, TailBindRequest request) {
    JobRow job = requireJob(jobId);
    if (!job.tailControlEnabled()) throw 422 "作业未启用列尾控制，不得绑定";
    if (status != ACCEPTED && != CHECKED) throw 422;
    if (bindingRepository.findActiveByJobId(jobId).isPresent()) throw 422 "已存在生效中绑定";
    TailDeviceRow device = deviceRepository.findByDeviceNo(request.deviceNo())
        .orElseThrow(404 "列尾装置不存在");
    Instant now = Instant.now(clock);
    if (!now.isBefore(device.selfTestValidUntil())) throw 422 "装置自检不合格或已过期";
    if (device.version() != request.expectedVersion()) throw 409 版本冲突;
    if (device.currentJobId() != null) throw 422 已占用;
    if (!deviceRepository.occupy(...)) {
        // 并发竞争失败，重新查询给出准确原因
        TailDeviceRow latest = requireDevice;
        if (latest.version() != expected) throw 409;
        throw 422 已占用;
    }
    String tailCarNo = current tail car;
    long bindingId = bindingRepository.insert(jobId, device.id(), device.deviceNo(), tailCarNo, job.consistVersion(), request.requestId());
    return ...;
}
```

注意顺序：先校验版本/占用（基于读到的快照），再 CAS。CAS 失败重查。

确认逻辑：
```java
private TailConfirmationResponse doConfirm(long jobId, TailConfirmRequest request) {
    JobRow job = requireJob(jobId);
    TailBindingRow binding = bindingRepository.findActiveByJobId(jobId)
        .orElseThrow(422 "无生效中列尾绑定");
    String tailCarNo = currentTailCar(jobId);
    if (request.consistVersion() != job.consistVersion() || !request.tailCarNo().equals(tailCarNo))
        throw 422 "确认的尾车或编组版本与当前编组不一致";
    if (confirmationRepository.existsValidConfirmer(binding.id(), job.consistVersion(), request.confirmer()))
        throw 422 "该人员已确认当前编组版本";
    long id = confirmationRepository.insert(...);
    return ...;
}
```

解绑逻辑：
```java
private TailBindingResponse doUnbind(long jobId, TailUnbindRequest request) {
    JobRow job = requireJob(jobId);
